ODE8104 [*] The maintainers key in the manifest file must be a list of strings
 --> __manifest__.py:3:5
  |
1 | {
2 |     "name": "My Module",
3 |     "maintainers": "someone",
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
4 | }
  |
help: Turn the value into a list of strings
  |
2 |     "name": "My Module",
  -     "maintainers": "someone",
3 +     "maintainers": ["someone"],
4 | }
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

